00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:29.404
Get outta here with that nonsense.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.690
- This is like Kuman from
fifth grade all over again.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.629
- Oh (bleep) that, 12 times eight?

00:00:33.629 --> 00:00:35.487
