then I distrusted myself.

00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:36.787
- Ah shit, no, that's not it.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:37.971
I don't know what that one is.

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.341
- I forgot how to write numbers.

00:00:39.341 --> 00:00:41.651
- Why is this so hard?

00:00:43.389 --> 00:00:44.136
What?

00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:44.972
- Ah!

00:00:44.972 --> 00:00:46.121
- Ah!

00:00:46.121 --> 00:00:47.154
- There's like no time.

00:00:47.154 --> 00:00:48.361
- Oh, I'm cooking now.

00:00:48.361 --> 00:00:49.220
Uh oh, no.

00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:51.230
- Aw, shit.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:52.235
- You literally just have to do it

00:00:52.235 --> 00:00:53.826
