00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.084
- Ah!

00:00:59.084 --> 00:01:00.049
- No!

00:01:06.079 --> 00:01:06.940
- Shit.

00:01:08.021 --> 00:01:09.201
Oh my God, it's so fast.

00:01:11.063 --> 00:01:12.571
- Okay, I'm happy with that.

00:01:12.571 --> 00:01:13.489
That's great.

00:01:13.489 --> 00:01:17.843
I felt dumb because I like
forgot what two times 11 was.

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:20.350
- Fine because I don't,

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.604
I haven't had to do multiplication

00:01:21.604 --> 00:01:23.229
like that since third grade.

00:01:23.229 --> 00:01:27.096
- 32 out of 60 ain't bad
in a minute, in my opinion.

00:01:27.096 --> 00:01:29.312
My parents might just spank
me five times instead of 20.

00:01:29.312 --> 00:01:32.110
- Oh, that's still an F, but yay.

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:33.527
- That's better than half.

00:01:33.527 --> 00:01:35.036
The goal is to not embarrass yourself?

00:01:35.036 --> 00:01:36.348
Then I think I succeeded.

00:01:36.348 --> 00:01:39.413
- Ah, that's not great.

00:01:39.413 --> 00:01:40.449
I mean...

00:01:41.654 --> 00:01:43.678
- Yeah, I could have done better though.

00:01:43.678 --> 00:01:45.338
- My heart is very heavy right now.

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:47.729
